# VRChat SDK surface → the `udon_runtime` abstraction layer.
#
# Everything here routes through the `Udon` autoload (the world provider a Godot game
# implements) or through adapter objects it returns (UdonPlayer, UdonPickup, UdonStation,
# UdonObjectSync, UdonObjectPool, UdonVideoPlayer). Behaviour-level calls resolve on the
# `UdonBehaviour` base class of every converted script.

